    <language></language>
    <type></type>
    <title>Four Lights: lunar south-pole landing sites</title>
    <abstract>Twelve south-pole sites with the Slip Planner's verdicts, each site's terrain skyline and the terrain behind them. Every layer is read over HTTP; there is no database. Terrain: NASA LOLA. Regions: USGS Artemis navigation grids. Sun and Earth: NASA JPL Horizons.</abstract>
